Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.22,0:00:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}只剩三张兵力票，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.03,0:00:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}还能赢吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.33,0:00:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}这场据点争夺，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.97,0:00:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}最后真的险胜了。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.39,0:00:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}这是虫潮围城的战地模式。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.09,0:00:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}旧镇、通信站、补给仓库，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.97,0:00:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}抢的就是这三个点。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.52,0:00:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}控制两个点，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.68,0:00:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}就会持续扣掉对面的兵力票。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.22,0:00:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}光顾着追人，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.50,0:00:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}旗子被偷，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.58,0:00:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}照样会输。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.00,0:00:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}喜欢这个玩法，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.43,0:00:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}顺手点个赞。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.75,0:00:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}这次没有买兵和升级。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.09,0:00:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}五种兵种用固定装备，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.22,0:00:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}开局我选工程兵，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.02,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}先开坦克推进。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.45,0:00:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}这段是另开一局补拍的载具战。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.34,0:00:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}坦克沿着道路推进，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.05,0:00:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}挨打会掉装甲，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.53,0:00:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}步兵也在往旗点靠。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.35,0:00:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}回到主战局，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.67,0:00:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}第一波我就倒了。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.34,0:00:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}但不用一直从老家跑：选已经占住的仓库，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.75,0:00:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}换成医疗兵，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.98,0:00:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}再部署到前线。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.32,0:00:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}残血的时候按支援，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.21,0:00:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}血量就能补回来。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.93,0:00:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}活着留在圈里，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.37,0:01:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}比冲出去再送一次更有用。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.59,0:01:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}中间的通信站反复易手。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.27,0:01:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}我贴着掩体交火，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.94,0:01:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}再扔手雷压住路口。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.87,0:01:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}对面也会开车和反扑，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.14,0:01:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}真不能一直硬冲。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.75,0:01:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}到最后，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.75,0:01:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}两边兵力都见底了。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.84,0:01:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}我们守住通信站和仓库，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.09,0:01:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}对面票数归零，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.60,0:01:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}我方剩三票。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.02,0:01:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(1380,815)}结算挺有意思：我方击杀九十四，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.21,0:01:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(1380,815)}对面一百零五。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.81,0:01:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(1380,815)}杀得更多的一边，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.32,0:01:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(1380,815)}反而输了。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.68,0:01:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(1380,815)}抢点和保住自己，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.33,0:01:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(1380,815)}都得算进去。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.49,0:01:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}这一局靠占点赢下来了，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.60,0:01:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}正面硬冲还是很容易倒。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.07,0:01:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}下次我想试试兵种配合和侧翼夺点。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.56,0:01:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}虫潮围城现在可以在百宝箱试玩，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.51,0:01:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,815)}想玩什么也可以填愿望单。
